rtant things  in life  private economy cannot provide it for  you cannot provide you the security only  government can but that always comes at  the price of your freedom and liberty  both economic and personal  yeah and that's what i mean about  feature not a bug it's like a guy like  de blasio he wrecked new york city but  in his view it's like oh but the  government's doing more now so thus this  is good and i think that that's sort of  what's going on all over the place so to  that point uh obviously there's midterms  coming you know everybody's talking  about some some big red  wave or something i'm pretty sure we're  going to be safe here  in florida do you by the way do you say  florida or florida i'm a new yorker  originally so i say florida you say  everyone's saying florida here but i  also say orange juice not orange juice  so i don't know no no one's ever i mean  i've heard about nevada and nevada but  i've never heard of florida in florida i  don't know what i say florida  i don't know you say florida i say  florida i people are telling me it's in  new york then we say florida we say  orange instead of orange but what do you  what do you think is going to happen in  in this uh midterm situation i mean do  you think we can actually capture i mean  we i never would have said we before but  i think it's we at this point uh you  know get the house back it sounds like  the senate's gonna do pretty well and  what do you what do you say well the  easiest way to lose at anything is to  think is to act like you're winning so i  think that's the first thing we have to  keep in mind the second is i mean  these guys raise a lot of money okay as  an example right chuck schumer went out  and hand-picked val demings the  congresswoman from central florida was  just a puppet of nancy pelosi and said  that's who i want to be our candidate in  florida and she's raising 10 million  dollars a quarter or more online just  sending out an email so they're going to  raise that